  "_readme": "Drop a .glb in this folder and flip its slot to enabled:true to replace the built-in procedural model. The game loads <slot>.glb unless you set \"file\". Set enabled:false (or delete the entry) to fall back to the procedural model. rotate is degrees [x,y,z] applied before auto-fit; scale is an extra multiplier after auto-fit; offset is metres [x,y,z]. Append ?models=auto to the URL to probe for every slot without editing this file. See MODELS.md.",
